From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kara Monk <monkey1911@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:43:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] local-repo-config.sh: add [omarchy-sp11] above [omarchy],
 keep edge [omarchy]

With --local-repo upstream deletes the [omarchy] section and serves it from
the local directory. Our repository only holds the Surface Pro 11 packages, so
deleting edge [omarchy] loses hyprland, omarchy-keyring and
limine-mkinitcpio-hook and the build fails at 'pacman -Sy omarchy-keyring'.
The local repository becomes [omarchy-sp11], listed first so its packages win,
and edge stays. Running it on its own output changes nothing.
bin/omarchy-iso-make still wants $LOCAL_REPO/omarchy.db; the build links
omarchy.db to omarchy-sp11.db.

Adapted from omarchy-dragon-sl7 (qBitnaut, MIT).
---
 builder/local-repo-config.sh | 20 ++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/builder/local-repo-config.sh b/builder/local-repo-config.sh
index e32516d..561945e 100644
--- a/builder/local-repo-config.sh
+++ b/builder/local-repo-config.sh
@@ -1,18 +1,26 @@
 #!/bin/bash
 set -euo pipefail
 
-# Local rebuilds must take precedence over distribution packages.
+# Local rebuilds must take precedence over distribution packages. The local
+# repository is added as [omarchy-sp11] directly above the other repositories,
+# and the published [omarchy] repository stays: it still supplies hyprland,
+# aquamarine, omarchy-keyring, limine-mkinitcpio-hook and the rest of the
+# edge packages the local repository does not carry.
+
+# Already configured: leave the file as it is.
+if grep -qx '\[omarchy-sp11\]' "$1"; then
+  cat "$1"
+  exit 0
+fi
+
 awk '
-  /^\[omarchy\]$/ { skip = 1; next }
-  /^\[/ { skip = 0 }
-  skip { next }
   /^\[/ && $0 != "[options]" && !inserted {
-    print "[omarchy]\nSigLevel = Optional TrustAll\nServer = file:///omarchy-repo\n"
+    print "[omarchy-sp11]\nSigLevel = Optional TrustAll\nServer = file:///omarchy-repo\n"
     inserted = 1
   }
   { print }
   END {
     if (!inserted)
-      print "\n[omarchy]\nSigLevel = Optional TrustAll\nServer = file:///omarchy-repo"
+      print "\n[omarchy-sp11]\nSigLevel = Optional TrustAll\nServer = file:///omarchy-repo"
   }
 ' "$1"
